# g7-infra: nearly everything here runs on Linux (G7, Miami), and is copied up with scp from
# this working copy. Check it out with LF on Windows too, so a script never reaches G7 with CRLF
# line endings (bash fails on them). Files that run on Windows keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
